Description: @DISTRIBUTION@ full GNOME — maps, weather, more
 Adds the "full GNOME" app set beyond the core desktop.  Mirrors the
 delta between the upstream `gnome-core` metapackage (minimal) and
 `gnome` (full):
 .
   * gnome-maps, gnome-weather    location-aware utilities
   * gnome-characters             Unicode character browser
   * gnome-font-viewer            font preview / install GUI
   * gnome-color-manager          ICC color profile management
   * gnome-backgrounds            extra wallpaper set
   * gnome-bluetooth-sendto       Bluetooth file send-to integration
   * gnome-user-share             personal file sharing daemon
   * gnome-sushi                  Nautilus quick-preview
   * gnome-initial-setup          first-boot welcome wizard
   * gnome-remote-desktop         RDP / VNC server
   * fonts-cantarell              GNOME's default UI font
   * seahorse                     GNOME keyring + GPG key GUI
   * zenity                       shell-script dialog helper
 .
 Selecting this metapackage automatically pulls asgard-gnome-desktop.
